<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sallie Mae cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sallie Mae cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it downgraded Student Loan Marketing Association (Sallie Mae) to neutral from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Sallie Mae lost 1 to 130-1/2 in morning exchange trading.</p>
<p>-- On Wednesday, Sallie Mae's chief executive Lawrence Hough said he planned to resign.</p>
</text>
